  <ThingDef ParentName="Rimshi_SkeletonPartBase">
    <defName>Rimshi_IndustrialArm</defName>
    <label>industrial skeleton arm</label>
    <description>A replacement arm for a skeleton. A heavy industrial pattern part with oversized motors and doubled muscle. It takes 8% less damage. It is stronger than the original, and its wearer hits 10% harder in melee per arm. Only fits a skeleton.</description>
